    "aggregates": "In tsinfer-anc-eval, uv run snakemake data/anc_eval_new/dataframes/PREFIX-aggregated.csv --cores all with the original 20 Mb, n6000, seed1, error-profile configuration. This describes the producer target, not a recovered original invocation; current upstream config is a different pilot.",
